    "body": "I'm thinking of replacing these paragraphs with an algorithm for how to get the groups of a `dl` element, since right now they are probably a bit confusing and not so helpful if someone wants to actually get the groups of a `dl` element (in an HTML scraping tool for example).\n\nMy thinking is that the algorithm should be something like this:\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4601\n",
